const s="概览",n="成果",e="影像资料",a="设计决策",i="技术栈",l="测试",d="包",c="模块",h="设备",m="扬声器",u="相机",p="画面",g="规则",f="通过",w="仿真",b="操作端",v="云端",y="工具",S="机器人",k="范围",C="控制器",t="运行环境",A="热源",P="部分",M="导出",T="交付",x="绿色",U="中型",I="黄色",R="红色",r="验证记录",o="通过条件",F="发现",N={"Stairio Simulator":"Stairio 仿真器","Testing a handrail inspection robot without the stairwell":"无需实地楼梯间，测试扶手巡检机器人","Stairio Simulator — Testing a Handrail Inspection Robot Without the Stairwell":"Stairio Simulator：不用真实楼梯间，也能测试扶手巡检机器人","Sole developer":"独立开发","Watch the explainer":"观看讲解视频","Stairio website":"Stairio 官网",Overview:"概览",Result:"成果","Watch it":"观看视频","What it gives the team":"给团队带来什么",Media:e,"The problem":"要解决的问题","How it works":"工作原理","The robot’s own controller":"机器人的原始控制器","Virtual devices":"虚拟设备","Swappable stairwells":"可随时切换的楼梯间","Floor tracking":"楼层追踪","Cameras and 360°":"相机与 360°","One operator, local or cloud":"同一个操作端，本地或云端","Safety and session rules":"安全与会话规则","Testing and validation":"测试与验证",Decisions:a,"Simulation scope":"仿真范围",Stack:"技术栈","Operator app":"操作端","Same app for both":"两条路径共用","Robot controller (V7)":"机器人控制程序（V7）","On the robot’s Pi":"运行在机器人的 Pi 上","Real hardware":"真实硬件","Motor (CAN), IMU, cameras":"电机（CAN）、IMU、相机","Real stairwell":"真实楼梯间","In someone’s building":"在别人的大楼里","Virtual Pi, same code":"虚拟 Pi，同一份代码","Motor, IMU, cameras":"电机、IMU、相机","Unreal stairwell":"Unreal 楼梯间","3 prepared scenes":"3 个预置场景","Run journal":"运行 log","Events, commands, captures":"事件、指令、拍摄记录","Pick a stairwell":"选择楼梯间","From the scene catalogue":"从场景目录中选","Close the old run":"结束上一次运行","Journal kept, robot stopped":"保留 log，机器人停止","Load in Unreal":"在 Unreal 中载入","About 6 s":"约 6 秒","Fresh session":"全新会话","Stationary, new identity":"静止状态，新的身份","Old commands rejected":"旧指令被拒绝","Wrong session or epoch":"会话或 epoch 不符","Stairio robots inspect fire-escape stairwells by riding the handrail. Testing their software used to need a real stairwell: those are in other people’s buildings, and we can’t build a multi-floor staircase at our test site. So every software change waited for time on real stairs. I built a simulator that brings the stairwell, and the robot, onto a computer.":"Stairio 机器人沿着扶手行走，巡检消防楼梯间。以前测试它的软件必须用真实楼梯间：这些楼梯间都在别人的大楼里，我们的测试场地也搭不出多层楼梯。于是每一次软件改动，都得等到能用上真实楼梯才能验证。我做了一个仿真器，把楼梯间和机器人一起搬进电脑。","Stairio robot on a stairwell handrail beside an exit door":"Stairio 机器人挂在楼梯扶手上，旁边是安全出口","The robot’s own controller software drives it along the handrail of a 20-floor stairwell, from a desk: no building visit, no rig, no risk to the hardware.":"机器人自己的控制软件在办公桌前驱动它沿扶手走完一座 20 层楼梯间：不用跑现场，不用搭试验台，也不会伤到硬件。","Original code files":"原始代码文件","Run byte-for-byte unchanged from the robot’s V7 0.37.0 snapshot":"与机器人 V7 0.37.0 快照逐字节一致，原样运行","Prepared stairwells":"预置楼梯间","Including a 20-floor building; each loads in about 6 s":"包括一栋 20 层大楼；每个约 6 秒载入","Same app":"同一个应用","The app that drives the real robot drives the simulator, locally or through the cloud":"驱动真实机器人的应用，也能在本地或经云端驱动仿真器","Test at a desk, any time":"随时在办公桌前测试","No site visit and no booking: a software change can be tried the moment it is written.":"不用跑现场，也不用预约：软件一改完就能马上试。","Swap stairwells in seconds":"几秒钟切换楼梯间","Three prepared stairwells, including a 20-floor building, each loading in about 6 seconds with the robot stopped at the start.":"三个预置楼梯间，包括一栋 20 层大楼；每个约 6 秒载入，机器人停在起点。","The robot’s own code":"机器人自己的代码","The controller that runs on the robot runs here, driven from the normal operator app.":"机器人上运行的控制程序，在这里照样运行，由平时用的操作端驱动。","Try faults safely":"安全地测试故障","Switch off motor feedback, stall the motor or drop a sensor, with no risk to the robot.":"可以切断电机反馈、让电机堵转或让某个传感器掉线，机器人毫无风险。","The simulated robot riding the handrail of the 20-floor stairwell in Unreal Engine":"Unreal Engine 中，仿真机器人沿着 20 层楼梯间的扶手运行","Software simulation: the robot riding the handrail of the 20-floor stairwell in Unreal Engine 5.":"软件仿真：机器人在 Unreal Engine 5 的 20 层楼梯间里沿扶手运行。","Software-in-the-loop":"软件在环","Unreal Engine 5":"Unreal Engine 5",Testing:"测试","On-site testing doesn’t scale. A real stairwell means a building visit and time on someone else’s stairs, and a multi-floor staircase can’t be built at our test site. A useful replacement had to meet three conditions: run the robot’s real controller rather than a copy, produce camera images from where the real lenses sit, and offer stairwells that can be repeated exactly.":"现场测试无法规模化。用真实楼梯间就要跑一趟大楼、借用别人的楼梯，而我们的测试场地也搭不出多层楼梯。要替代现场测试，必须满足三个条件：运行机器人真实的控制程序而不是副本；相机画面要从真实镜头所在的位置拍出；楼梯间要能一模一样地重复使用。","Only the hardware is swapped":"只换掉硬件","Commands go down from the operator app and sensor feedback comes back up, on both paths. The controller boxes hold the same code.":"两条路径上，指令都从操作端往下传，传感器反馈再往上回。两个控制程序方框里是同一份代码。","The operator app drives either the real robot controller, which runs real hardware on a real stairwell, or the same controller code on a virtual Pi, which runs virtual devices in an Unreal stairwell and writes a run journal":"操作端既可以驱动真实机器人的控制程序，在真实楼梯间里操作真实硬件；也可以驱动虚拟 Pi 上的同一份控制程序代码，在 Unreal 楼梯间里操作虚拟设备并写入运行 log（日志）","A Python virtual Pi hosts the robot’s V7 edge runtime. Its hardware factory builds virtual devices instead of physical ones, and Unreal Engine 5 supplies the stairwell, the robot’s pose and the camera images. The controller itself runs in the virtual Pi, not inside Unreal, and every event, command and capture goes into a run journal that can be replayed.":"Python 写的虚拟 Pi 承载机器人的 V7 edge runtime（边缘运行时）。它的硬件工厂创建的是虚拟设备而不是实体设备，Unreal Engine 5 负责提供楼梯间、机器人的位姿和相机画面。控制程序本身运行在虚拟 Pi 里，而不是 Unreal 内部；每个事件、指令和拍摄都写入可回放的运行 log（日志）。","The controller comes from a read-only copy of the robot’s V7 0.37.0 software, captured on 19 September 2026. The archive hash and all 61 files inside it were checked. Of its 19 Python modules, 18 are byte-identical in the simulator. The one that differs, edge.py, changes only its hardware factory: its 39-method EdgeRuntime class is AST-identical to the original, and the CAN regulator loops are inherited unchanged.":"控制程序来自 2026 年 9 月 19 日以只读方式复制的机器人 V7 0.37.0 软件。压缩包的哈希值和包内全部 61 个文件都经过核对。19 个 Python 模块中，有 18 个在仿真器里逐字节一致。唯一不同的 edge.py 只改了硬件工厂：含 39 个方法的 EdgeRuntime 类与原版的 AST 完全一致，CAN 调节回路也原样继承。","Floor navigation is a separate, versioned extension (the audited 0.91.1 navigation source described under Floor tracking) and is not part of the 18 of 19 byte-identical count.":"楼层导航是一个单独的、带版本号的扩展（即「楼层跟踪」中介绍的、经过审计的 0.91.1 导航源码），不计入上述 19 个模块中 18 个逐字节一致的统计。",Package:"包",Modules:"模块","In the simulator":"在仿真器中","Byte-identical (8 of 8)":"逐字节一致（8/8）","Byte-identical (7 of 7)":"逐字节一致（7/7）","Byte-identical (3 of 3)":"逐字节一致（3/3）","Hardware factory":"硬件工厂","Four eager hardware imports removed; the physical factory replaced by virtual devices. EdgeRuntime class unchanged":"去掉四个启动时就加载的硬件导入；实体硬件工厂换成虚拟设备。EdgeRuntime 类不变","Verified against the V7 0.37.0 snapshot by file hash. Regression tests compare the EdgeRuntime syntax tree, the complete CAN module and the inherited regulator methods.":"通过文件哈希与 V7 0.37.0 快照核对。回归测试比较 EdgeRuntime 语法树、完整 CAN 模块及继承的调速方法。",Device:"设备","On the robot":"机器人上","Motor drive":"电机驱动","C610 over CAN":"C610，经 CAN 连接","Virtual CAN transport with synthetic motor feedback. The original regulator stays: closed-loop RPM, current limit, overspeed and stall detection. Feedback-loss and stalled-motor faults can be switched on":"虚拟 CAN 传输，电机反馈为合成数据。原有调节器全部保留：闭环 RPM、电流限制、超速与堵转检测。可以开启反馈丢失和电机堵转故障","Follows the stair slope and landing turns of the scene; stationary and manual inputs are available for tests":"跟随场景中的楼梯坡度和平台转弯；测试时也可以改用静止或手动输入","Environment sensor":"环境传感器","Scenario values that the original firmware reads and publishes":"按场景设定的数值，由原有固件读取并发布",Speaker:"扬声器","Pi audio output":"Pi 的音频输出","The workstation speaker plays the robot’s eight firmware prompts and two tones":"由工作站的扬声器播放机器人固件里的八段提示音和两种音调",Cameras:"相机","Dual-fisheye camera":"双鱼眼相机","Rendered in Unreal at the physical lens positions: front and rear live views, stills and 360° captures":"在 Unreal 中按真实镜头位置渲染：前后两路实时画面、照片和 360° 拍摄","Virtual motor faults stop output and revoke control. Motion resumes through an explicit start command after the fault is cleared.":"虚拟电机故障会停止输出并撤销控制权。清除故障后，需要明确的启动命令才能恢复运动。","Loading a stairwell starts a clean run":"载入楼梯间就是一次全新的运行","Each scene in the catalogue has pinned map and model hashes, so a run names exactly what it ran on.":"目录中的每个场景都固定了地图和模型的哈希值，所以每次运行都能准确说明它用的是哪个场景。","Pick a stairwell, close the old run, load it in Unreal, start a fresh stationary session, and reject commands from the old session":"选择楼梯间，结束上一次运行，在 Unreal 中载入，开始一个全新的静止会话，并拒绝来自旧会话的指令","Simulated robot on the handrail of the common return stairwell":"仿真机器人挂在常见折返式楼梯间的扶手上","Common return stairwell.":"常见的折返式楼梯间。","Simulated robot on the handrail of a straight staircase":"仿真机器人挂在直跑楼梯的扶手上","Straight 10-riser staircase.":"10 级踏步的直跑楼梯。","Simulated robot on the steel handrail of the 20-floor stairwell":"仿真机器人挂在 20 层楼梯间的钢扶手上","20-floor Blender reference: 39 landings, G to 19.":"20 层 Blender 参考场景：39 个楼梯平台，从 G 到 19。","The robot counts floors from landing turns in its IMU signal. The simulator uses audited navigation source from version 0.91.1 with two documented corrections: a corner split into two bends by a short straight still counts as one turn, and gravity is predicted from the gyro so its filter no longer lags the change in slope. In route replay it detects all 37 return turns at both 30 and 120 RPM; in the live run the operator app confirmed G → 0M → 1.":"机器人根据 IMU 信号中的平台转弯来数楼层。仿真器使用经过审计的 0.91.1 版导航源码，并加了两处有文档记录的修正：被一小段直道分成两个弯的转角，仍算作一次转弯；重力方向由陀螺仪预测，滤波不再落后于坡度变化。路线回放中，30 和 120 RPM 下 37 个折返转弯全部识别；实时运行时，操作端确认了 G → 0M → 1。","Explainer frame: the simulated robot at a landing beside live motor feedback, IMU rotation rate, a landing-turn gauge at 180° and the floor tile showing 0M":"讲解视频截图：仿真机器人停在楼梯平台，旁边是实时电机反馈、IMU 角速度、指向 180° 的平台转弯仪表，以及显示 0M 的楼层方块","From the explainer: motor feedback, IMU rotation rate and the floor change G → 0M, drawn from the run journal of the same take, with the operator app’s telemetry.":"摘自讲解视频：电机反馈、IMU 角速度和楼层变化 G → 0M，均取自同一次录制的运行 log（日志），旁边是操作端的遥测数据。","Landing turns provide the floor estimate. Top-floor arrival requires an additional signal or explicit reference. The underlying controller remains pinned to V7 0.37.0.":"平台转弯用于估计楼层。到达顶层需要额外信号或明确的参考点，底层控制器固定为 V7 0.37.0。",Image:"画面","How it is made":"生成方式","What it shows":"用途","Front and rear live views":"前后两路实时画面","Rendered from the lens surfaces of the robot model":"从机器人模型的镜头表面渲染","What each camera would see from its mount":"每台相机在安装位置上会看到的画面","Saved 360° panorama":"保存的 360° 全景","Two hemispheres rendered at the two lens origins at one scene time, saved at 2048×1024":"在同一场景时刻，从两个镜头原点各渲染一个半球，保存为 2048×1024","Look-around review; lens baseline parallax stays visible at the seams":"用于环视查看；两个镜头之间的基线视差会留在接缝处","Cloud live stream":"云端实时 video stream（视频流）","The Pi camera’s 1280×480 dual-fisheye format at about 2 fps (1.91 measured)":"采用 Pi 相机的 1280×480 双鱼眼格式，约 2 fps（实测 1.91）","Simulator stream compatible with the hosted viewer":"与云端查看器兼容的仿真 video stream（视频流）","The midpoint between the lenses is only a rig reference; it sits inside the housing and is never used as an optical origin.":"两个镜头之间的中点只是装配参考点，它位于外壳内部，从不作为光学原点使用。","The same web operator connects to the simulator through compatible robot APIs. A local backend serves offline tests; the cloud path implements the remote API contract with a dedicated simulated-device identity.":"同一个网页操作端通过兼容的机器人 API 连接仿真器。本地 backend（后端）支持离线测试，云端路径实现远程 API 契约，并使用独立的模拟设备身份。","Operator app showing the 20-floor stairwell map with floor labels, device control at 120 RPM, telemetry and saved 360° captures":"操作端画面：带楼层标签的 20 层楼梯间地图、120 RPM 的设备控制、遥测数据和已保存的 360° 拍摄","The operator app on the simulator: floor map with 39 labelled landings, device control and observed telemetry. The robot is at 0M.":"连接仿真器的操作端：标出 39 个楼梯平台的楼层地图、设备控制和观测到的遥测数据。机器人此时在 0M。",Rule:"规则","What it does":"作用","Motion lease":"运动租约","Start holds a 1.5 s motion lease under a 3 s owner lease; closing the page or losing the connection ends it":"按下 Start 后持有 1.5 秒的运动租约，外层是 3 秒的控制者租约；关闭页面或连接中断，租约随即结束","Explicit takeover":"显式接管","A second client has to take control, and doing so stops current motion":"第二个客户端必须主动接管控制权，接管时会停止当前运动","Stop always works":"Stop 始终可用","Stop stays available even when the journal has failed or been finalised":"即使 log（日志）写入失败或已经封存，Stop 仍然可用","Unreal heartbeat":"Unreal 心跳","Leaving Play, changing scene or session, or losing a fresh heartbeat revokes motion and calibration":"退出 Play、切换场景或会话，或收不到新的心跳，都会收回运动和标定","No automatic resume":"不会自动恢复","After a reconnect the virtual Pi needs an explicit restart; an old Start request can never resume motion":"重新连接后，虚拟 Pi 必须明确重启；旧的 Start 请求永远不能恢复运动","Validation starts with controller and asset checks, then exercises repeatable scenarios. The simulator completes the software stages; component, Pi and route testing extend the workflow to hardware.":"验证从控制器与模型检查开始，再运行可重复的场景测试。仿真器完成软件阶段，部件实验、Pi 测试与实地路线测试将验证延伸至硬件。","Validation stage":"验证阶段","What it checks":"检查内容","Next stage":"后续阶段","Controller and asset inspection":"控制器与模型检查","Dimensions, topology, assets and controller code":"尺寸、拓扑、模型与控制器代码","Physical fit checks":"实物装配检查","Scripted or recorded fixture":"脚本或录制的测试样例","Software responses to defined inputs, messages and faults":"软件对指定输入、消息与故障的响应","Measured sensor and mechanism inputs":"实测传感器与机构输入","Calibrated component experiment":"经标定的部件实验","Model response against component measurements":"模型响应与部件实测结果的对比","Whole-robot testing":"整机测试","Pi with virtual I/O":"接虚拟 I/O 的 Pi","Runtime timing and resources under a defined load":"指定负载下的运行时序与资源使用","Electrical, power-loss and traction tests":"电气、断电与牵引力测试","Controlled physical route":"受控的实物路线","Robot behaviour on a specified rail and site":"机器人在指定扶手与场地的行为","Additional stairwell profiles":"其他楼梯间类型","The first two stages run in software; the remaining stages use physical hardware.":"前两个阶段在软件中运行，其余阶段使用实体硬件。","Simulator checkpoint, 5 October 2026.":"仿真器进度检查点，2026 年 10 月 5 日。","Live acceptance run":"实时验收运行","Real Unreal run with front, rear and live 360° rendering at once, 120 RPM, floors G → 0M → 1 and three saved captures":"在真实 Unreal 中运行：同时渲染前、后和实时 360° 画面，120 RPM，楼层 G → 0M → 1，并保存了三次拍摄","Frame age":"画面时效","Every camera frame during the acceptance run":"验收运行期间的每一帧相机画面","Control acknowledgement":"控制确认","36.7 ms worst":"最差 36.7 ms","Operator command to device acknowledgement":"从操作端发出指令到设备确认","Stop acknowledged in 1.4 ms":"Stop 在 1.4 ms 内确认","Recovery run":"恢复测试",Passed:"通过","Lease expiry, competing clients and takeover, feedback and IMU faults, restart during queued panoramas, stale-session rejection and scene replacement":"租约过期、多个客户端争夺与接管、反馈与 IMU 故障、全景拍摄排队时重启、拒绝过期会话，以及切换场景","A saved image and its metadata survived every transition unchanged":"一张已保存的图片及其元数据在每次切换后都保持不变","Continuous drive":"连续行驶","Through the operator app at 120 RPM, across several landings":"通过操作端以 120 RPM 行驶，途经多个楼梯平台","Automated tests":"Automated testing（自动化测试）","Simulator suite, five skipped":"仿真器测试套件，5 项跳过","Which stairwells can be loaded?":"可以载入哪些楼梯间？","Import any staircase":"导入任意楼梯","A catalogue of prepared scenes":"一份预置场景目录","A prepared scene has a checked rail route, collision geometry and pinned hashes, so a run is repeatable and names exactly what it ran on. An arbitrary import would make every result depend on an unchecked model.":"预置场景的扶手路线和碰撞几何都检查过，哈希值也固定下来，所以运行可以重复，并能准确说明用的是哪个场景。如果允许随意导入，每个结果都会建立在未经检查的模型之上。","Each new stairwell needs a prepared model and checked rail route.":"每个新楼梯间都需要准备模型并检查扶手路线。","How should motion look smooth in recordings?":"录制视频时，怎样让运动看起来流畅？","Change the evidence pose":"修改作为证据的位姿","Display-only smoothing, off by default":"只作用于显示的平滑，默认关闭","Recordings need smooth 60 fps motion, but evidence must stay raw. The smoothing only changes what the viewport shows, runs about 100 ms behind, and is reported in the bridge status while it is on.":"录制需要流畅的 60 fps 画面，但证据必须保持原始数据。平滑只改变视口里显示的内容，大约落后 100 ms，开启期间会在桥接状态中注明。","Camera and pose validation use the unsmoothed session.":"相机与位姿验证使用未平滑的会话。",Simulation:"仿真","Python 3.13 virtual Pi":"Python 3.13 虚拟 Pi","Robot software":"机器人软件","V7 edge runtime":"V7 edge runtime（边缘运行时）","REST and SSE":"REST 与 SSE",Operator:"操作端",Cloud:"云端",Tooling:"工具","Native Unreal MCP":"Unreal 原生 MCP","Which engine should the simulator be built on?":"仿真器应基于哪个引擎搭建？","The robot follows a rail, so its motion is simple and needs little dynamics data. What the inspection problem needs is realistic visual data for camera coverage and AI findings, which is where Unreal is strongest.":"机器人沿扶手行走，运动简单，需要的动力学数据很少。巡检真正需要的是逼真的视觉数据，用于相机覆盖分析和 AI 问题识别，这正是 Unreal 的强项。","Unreal handles scene and sensor work; accurate wheel-contact dynamics would require a calibrated companion model.":"Unreal 负责场景与传感器模拟，精确的轮轨接触动力学需要经过标定的配套模型。","Where does the control policy live during simulation?":"仿真时，控制策略在哪里运行？","Reimplemented inside the simulator":"在仿真器里重新实现","The robot’s real controller, connected to virtual devices":"机器人真实的控制程序，连接虚拟设备","One controller implementation means the simulator tests the code that ships, not a copy that can drift from it.":"控制程序只有一份实现，仿真器测试的就是实际交付的代码，而不是一份可能逐渐偏离原版的副本。","Read-only audit of the robot":"机器人只读审计","The read-only audit captured the controller and device configuration: closed-loop RPM control with a configured current ceiling, plus IMU acquisition at 50 Hz and publication at 10 Hz. Physical current-limit qualification is a separate bench test.":"只读审查记录了控制器与设备配置：带设定电流上限的转速闭环控制，以及 50 Hz 采集、10 Hz 发布的 IMU。实际电流限制性能通过独立台架测试验证。","Can the robot computer be emulated?":"机器人的计算机可以模拟吗？","An ARM64 Linux guest provides a software-test target. Userspace compatibility, kernel behaviour and board-level behaviour are checked separately, with virtual CAN tests covering the software interface and hardware CAN tests covering the physical bus.":"ARM64 Linux 虚拟机提供软件测试环境。用户空间兼容性、内核行为与板级行为分别检查；虚拟 CAN 测试覆盖软件接口，硬件 CAN 测试覆盖实体总线。","Equirectangular 360° panorama of the simulated stairwell":"仿真楼梯间的等距柱状 360° 全景","A 360° panorama captured in the simulator, combined from two hemispheres rendered at the physical lens positions.":"仿真器中拍摄的 360° 全景，由在真实镜头位置渲染的两个半球画面合成。","Stairio Limited | Hong Kong":"Stairio Limited | 香港","Your browser does not support embedded video.":"你的浏览器不支持内嵌视频播放。",Robotics:"机器人","Recorded on 23 September 2026 in the 20-floor scene":"2026 年 9 月 23 日录制于 20 层场景","It is part of my work as Robotics Systems Engineer at Stairio, where I also built Stairio HR, the system the company uses to hire without an HR department. I am the simulator’s sole developer.":"这是我在 Stairio 担任机器人系统工程师的工作之一；我在 Stairio 还开发了 Stairio HR，公司不设 HR 部门，就靠这套系统招人。仿真器由我独立开发。","A 2:28 narrated walkthrough of the simulator, combining Blender product renders, Unreal recordings and real robot footage.":"2:28 配音讲解，结合 Blender 产品渲染、Unreal 仿真录屏与实体机器人实拍，介绍仿真器的完整流程。","Stairio product render created in Blender.":"使用 Blender 制作的 Stairio 产品渲染图。",Area:"范围","Simulation model":"仿真模型",Controller:"控制器","Pinned V7 0.37.0 software snapshot, with virtual hardware adapters":"固定版本的 V7 0.37.0 软件快照，连接虚拟硬件适配器","Motion and sensing":"运动与传感","Rail-following motion and synthetic sensor feedback; wheel contact, battery pendulum motion and real sensor noise are reserved for physical testing":"沿扶手运动与模拟传感器反馈；轮轨接触、电池摆动及真实传感器噪声通过实体测试验证","Unreal views rendered at the physical lens positions; optical calibration is a separate hardware test":"Unreal 在实体镜头位置渲染画面；光学标定通过独立硬件测试完成",Runtime:t,"Python virtual Pi with the Unreal editor; Pi timing, standalone packaging and autonomous operation on real stairs are separate validation steps":"Python 虚拟 Pi 配合 Unreal 编辑器；Pi 时序、独立打包与实体楼梯自主运行分别验证","Motor transport":"电机通信","Synthetic CAN feedback exercises the regulator; bus timing and electrical behaviour are checked on hardware":"通过模拟 CAN 反馈测试调速器；总线时序与电气行为在硬件上检查","The thermal results below use the side-shell-fitted casing at the fixed assumed loads, regardless of the airflow case selected above.":"以下热分析结果均采用装有侧壳的机壳及固定的假设热负载，不随上方气流工况的选择而改变。","Same code, not a copy":"同一份代码，不是副本","Testing and evidence levels":"测试与证据等级","What it doesn’t claim":"不作哪些结论","Still checked on real stairs":"仍要在真实楼梯上验证","Still checked on the real robot":"仍要在真实机器人上验证","Final checks still happen on real stairs.":"最终验证仍在真实楼梯上进行。","Wheel-on-rail contact physics and real sensor noise are not simulated.":"轮子与扶手的接触物理、真实传感器噪声都没有仿真。","Cameras are rendered at the robot’s lens positions; they are not a calibrated model of the real optics.":"相机画面在机器人镜头的位置渲染，但不是经过标定的真实光学模型。","Timing on the robot’s own computer is not reproduced.":"机器人自身计算机上的时序没有复现。","Camera coverage from one capture position: green is well covered, red is not.":"从一个拍摄位置看到的相机覆盖情况：绿色表示覆盖良好，红色表示覆盖不足。","Checked by hash against the snapshot. A regression test also compares the EdgeRuntime syntax tree, the whole CAN module and the inherited regulator methods. This describes the snapshot; the robots in service today were not contacted.":"以哈希值与快照逐一核对。另有回归测试比较 EdgeRuntime 的语法树、整个 CAN 模块和继承下来的调节方法。以上描述的是快照；目前在用的机器人并没有接入核对。","A motor fault stops output and revokes control; clearing it never restarts motion. Bus timing and electrical behaviour are not reproduced.":"电机故障会停止输出并收回控制权；故障清除后也不会自动恢复运动。总线时序和电气特性没有复现。","This is a floor estimate from landing turns, not precise localisation. Arrival at the top floor still needs an extra signal or an explicit reference, and the underlying 0.37.0 controller stays pinned.":"这是根据平台转弯推算出的楼层，不是精确定位。到达顶层仍需要额外的信号或明确的参考点；底层的 0.37.0 控制程序保持固定不变。","Format compatibility with the hosted viewer, not a frame-rate claim for the Pi":"证明与在线查看器的格式兼容，并不代表 Pi 的帧率","The same web operator finds the simulator through the robot API. A local backend serves offline tests; the cloud path uses the robot’s remote API contract with a separate simulated-device identity, so the simulator never poses as a physical unit. The accurate wording is “compatible with the robot’s API”, not identical paths.":"同一个网页操作端通过机器人 API 找到仿真器。离线测试由本地 backend（后端）提供；云端路径使用机器人的远程 API 约定，但仿真设备有独立的身份，所以仿真器从不冒充实体机器人。准确的说法是「与机器人的 API 兼容」，而不是路径完全相同。","Each result is stated with the evidence level it reached, so a passing software test is never read as a physical result.":"每项结果都注明它达到的证据等级，免得把通过的软件测试误读为实物结果。","Evidence level":"证据等级","Permitted conclusion":"可以下的结论","Still unproven":"仍未证明","Source and import inspection":"源文件与导入检查","Dimensions, topology and assets match the chosen source":"尺寸、拓扑和素材与所选来源一致","Physical fit outside sampled points":"抽查点以外的实物吻合程度","The software handles the given inputs, messages and failures":"软件能处理给定的输入、消息和故障","That sensors or mechanics will produce those inputs on a staircase":"传感器或机械结构在真实楼梯上会不会产生这些输入","A named model reproduces measured response within its tested range":"指定模型在测试范围内能复现实测响应","Whole-robot behaviour":"整机行为","Real runtime timing and resources under the tested load":"在测试负载下真实的运行时序与资源占用","Electrical devices, power loss, traction":"电气设备、断电、牵引力","Observed behaviour on the tested rail and site":"在测试扶手和场地上观察到的行为","Every other stairwell":"其他所有楼梯间","The simulator’s results sit at the first two levels. The last three need hardware.":"仿真器的结果属于前两个等级，后三个等级需要硬件。","Combined browser, audio and network-transition acceptance is still open":"浏览器、音频与网络切换的综合验收尚未完成","Adding a new stairwell is a modelling task, not a file drop.":"新增一个楼梯间需要建模，不是拖一个文件进来就行。","A smoothed session cannot be used as camera or pose evidence.":"开了平滑的会话不能用作相机或位姿证据。","Not simulated or not established":"没有仿真或尚未证实","Contact physics between the wheels and the rail":"轮子与扶手之间的接触物理","Pendulum dynamics of the hanging battery":"悬挂电池的摆动动力学","Physical camera calibration":"相机的实物标定","Timing on the robot’s Pi":"机器人 Pi 上的时序","A packaged runtime outside the Unreal editor":"脱离 Unreal 编辑器的打包运行版本","Physical autonomy":"实物自主运行","Identity with the firmware on the robots in service today":"与目前在用机器人的固件完全一致","Rigid-body contact is only an approximation of rubber wheels on a rail. If contact accuracy cannot meet the task, Unreal is narrowed to scene and sensor work and a companion dynamics backend is evaluated.":"刚体接触只能近似反映橡胶轮与扶手之间的接触。如果接触精度满足不了任务要求，Unreal 就只负责场景和传感器部分，另行评估配套的动力学 backend（后端）。","The robot was inspected and copied without sending any motor command, calibration or restart. Findings are paired with their boundary: closed-loop RPM control exists, but the configured current ceiling is not a measured qualification; the IMU is acquired at 50 Hz but published at 10 Hz.":"检查和复制机器人上的内容时，没有发送任何电机指令，也没有执行校准或重启。每条结论都注明了适用边界：闭环转速控制确实存在，但配置的电流上限并非实测得出的合格值；IMU 以 50 Hz 采集，但只以 10 Hz 发布。","A full ARM64 Linux guest is a useful software-test target; a complete virtual replacement for the physical robot is not established. Matching userspace, matching kernel and matching board are three separate claims, and a passed virtual CAN test is not a passed hardware CAN test.":"完整的 ARM64 Linux 虚拟机适合用来做软件测试；但能否用虚拟环境完全替代实体机器人，尚未得到证实。用户空间一致、内核一致、板卡一致是三个不同的结论；虚拟 CAN 测试通过，也不等于硬件 CAN 测试通过。","Recorded on 23 September 2026, before the final lighting revisions of the 20-floor scene":"2026 年 9 月 23 日录得，当时 20 层场景的灯光还未最终调整","The narrated 2:28 explainer. The opening shot is a Blender render, the Unreal shots are recorded from the simulator, and the clip of the real robot near the end is labelled as real footage.":"2 分 28 秒的讲解视频，带旁白。开场镜头是 Blender 渲染，Unreal 镜头均录自仿真器，片尾附近真实机器人的片段已注明为实拍画面。","Rendered in Blender, not simulator footage.":"此图用 Blender 渲染，并非仿真器画面。","Heat & airflow research":"热与气流研究","Heat loads, temperatures & evidence":"热负荷、温度与证据","New research: casing airflow and component temperatures":"新增研究：外壳气流与部件温度","Explore the ANSYS Fluent pilot, its source reports and the measurements still needed.":"查看 ANSYS Fluent 初步研究、原始报告，以及仍需补充的测量。","ANSYS Fluent 2025 R2":"ANSYS Fluent 2025 R2","Steady laminar CFD":"稳态层流 CFD","Assumed-load thermal study":"基于假设负荷的热研究","ANSYS Fluent · 10–11 October 2026":"ANSYS Fluent · 2026 年 10 月 10–11 日","Alongside the controller tests, the simulator now carries a study of the casing itself: where cooling air enters, which components heat up, and what should be measured next. The results are available in the Virtual Pi console as a separate research view.":"除了控制程序测试，仿真器现在也收录了外壳本身的研究：冷却空气从哪里进入、哪些部件会升温，以及下一步应测量什么。结果可在 Virtual Pi 控制台的独立研究页面中查看。","A CFD pilot with assumed inputs":"输入值基于假设的 CFD 初步研究","Fan flow: assumed 1 CFM. Heat: assumed 6.75 W. Room: 25 °C. These are steady model results from archived V7 geometry, not temperatures measured on the robot. They do not drive the simulator’s sensor readings.":"假设风扇流量为 1 CFM、发热功率为 6.75 W，室温为 25 °C。这些是基于存档 V7 几何模型的稳态计算结果，并非机器人的实测温度，也不会用于生成仿真器的传感器读数。","The side-shell changes the intake path; camera power is the most consequential thermal unknown.":"侧壳会改变进气路径；相机功率是对热结果影响最大的未知量。","Intake through both side vents":"两侧通风口的进气占比","Side-shell fitted · about 24% per wall":"装有侧壳 · 每侧约 24%","Camera mean surface":"相机平均表面温度","Buoyancy on · assumed 1 W for both cameras":"计入浮力 · 假设两台相机合计 1 W","Pi board mean surface":"Pi 板平均表面温度","Buoyancy on · assumed 1.75 W on the middle board":"计入浮力 · 假设中间板发热 1.75 W","Compare the casing geometries":"比较外壳几何模型","Airflow case":"气流算例","Side-shell fitted · main case":"装有侧壳 · 主算例","Arch open · first run":"拱形口敞开 · 首次计算","Native Fluent pathlines, coloured by speed. Tracer playback is illustrative: the video clock is not physical flow time or robot warm-up time. Both clips use the same colour scale.":"Fluent 原生迹线，按速度着色。示踪播放仅作示意：视频时间不代表真实流动时间或机器人的升温时间。两段视频使用相同色标。","Airflow video · arch open":"气流视频 · 拱形口敞开","Airflow video · side-shell fitted":"气流视频 · 装有侧壳","Where the air enters":"空气从哪里进入","Flow-weighted share of casing intake; not a measured fresh-air fraction. Minor openings are omitted below.":"按流量加权的外壳进气占比，并非实测的新风比例。下方省略了少量进气的开口。","Horizontal side vents · both walls":"水平侧通风口 · 两侧合计","Underside and bottom openings":"下侧与底部开口","Top grille beside the fan":"风扇旁的顶部格栅","Camera-boss gaps":"相机凸台间隙","Fan-side arch":"风扇侧拱形口","The open arch dominates intake":"敞开的拱形口是主要进气路径","Closing the arch redirects the flow":"封闭拱形口会改变气流路径","The archived assembly omits the side-shell, leaving a large opening beneath the cameras. About 66% of the intake enters there, so this first run does not represent the fitted casing.":"存档装配体缺少侧壳，相机下方因此留下了一个大开口。约 66% 的进气从这里进入，因此首次计算并不代表装好侧壳后的情况。","With the side-shell fitted, about 47% enters through the side vents and 37% from below. The lower 90 mm shell extension is absent from the model, so the underside share is probably overstated.":"装有侧壳时，约 47% 的空气从侧通风口进入，37% 从下方进入。模型缺少下方 90 mm 的外壳延伸段，因此下方进气占比可能偏高。","Modelled pressure rise":"模型计算的压升","Motor-side mean air speed":"电机侧平均空气速度","Pressure rise describes casing resistance at the assumed 1 CFM. It is not a FAN-4007 rating or a measured fan operating point.":"压升表示假设流量为 1 CFM 时的外壳阻力，并非 FAN-4007 的额定参数或实测风扇工作点。","Inspect the solved intake map":"查看求解得到的进气分布图","Opening flux map for the arch-open casing":"拱形口敞开时的外壳开口通量图","Opening flux map for the side-shell-fitted casing":"装有侧壳时的外壳开口通量图","Source report figure for the selected geometry, from solved opening fluxes.":"所选几何模型在原始报告中的图示，根据求解得到的开口通量绘制。","The thermal study places heat on the motor, three generic boards and the two cameras. Comparing frozen airflow with buoyancy shows how heating changes the flow: the motor cools by about 3.6 K, while the cameras remain near 70 °C at their assumed combined 1 W.":"热研究在电机、三块通用板和两台相机上施加热负荷。比较冻结流场与计入浮力的结果，可观察发热如何改变气流：电机温度下降约 3.6 K，而两台相机在假设合计 1 W 的负荷下，温度仍接近 70 °C。","Model component":"模型部件","Assumed heat":"假设发热功率","B0 · frozen airflow":"B0 · 冻结流场","B1 · buoyancy on":"B1 · 计入浮力","Dual cameras · combined":"双相机 · 合计","Pi · middle board":"Pi · 中间板","Power manager · front board":"电源管理器 · 前板","C610 · back board":"C610 · 后板","Mean source-surface temperatures in a 25 °C room, corrected to the exact assumed loads. These are not chip-junction, motor-winding or BME688 temperatures. The Pi’s middle-board position is user supplied; the other board assignments and motor/C610 power split are study assumptions.":"室温为 25 °C 时的热源平均表面温度，已按假设负荷的精确值校正。这些并非芯片结温、电机绕组温度或 BME688 温度。Pi 位于中间板的位置由用户提供；其余板卡的对应关系，以及电机与 C610 之间的功率分配，均为研究假设。","Camera-boss housing peak":"相机凸台处的外壳峰值温度","Buoyancy on · corrected to full camera load":"计入浮力 · 已校正至完整相机负荷","Housing above the 50 °C review flag":"高于 50 °C 复核标记的壳面面积","As-solved field · mainly around the camera bosses":"求解原始场 · 主要位于相机凸台周围","Air at the fan":"风扇处的空气温度","Buoyancy on · BME688 location is unknown":"计入浮力 · BME688 位置未知","Casing temperature maps comparing frozen airflow and buoyancy, with hot camera bosses highlighted":"冻结流场与计入浮力的外壳温度对比图，突出显示高温的相机凸台","As-solved housing fields: the buoyancy-on peak is 66.4 °C before the camera-load correction above. Cyan marks faces above the 50 °C review flag, not an approved PLA limit. White marks vents or excluded surfaces; the fan-side arch remains closed.":"求解得到的原始外壳温度场：计入浮力时，应用上述相机负荷校正前的峰值为 66.4 °C。青色标出高于 50 °C 复核标记的壳面，这并非经认可的 PLA 温度限值。白色表示通风口或未纳入的表面；风扇侧拱形口保持封闭。","Per-watt response and earlier screening studies":"每瓦响应与早期筛查研究","With one source alone and airflow frozen, the cameras rise about 44 K per combined watt, compared with 11–16 K/W for the boards and motor. Read these rises as about ±25% from numerical sensitivity. Cross-heating is needed for new load combinations; the buoyancy-on results cannot simply be scaled.":"在单独施加一个热源且冻结流场时，两台相机的合计功率每增加 1 W，温升约为 44 K；板卡和电机则为 11–16 K/W。根据数值敏感性，这些温升应按约 ±25% 理解。新的负荷组合还需考虑热源间的相互加热；计入浮力的结果不能简单按比例缩放。",Source:"热源","Surface rise per watt":"每瓦表面温升","Earlier · shell conduction screening":"早期研究 · 外壳导热筛查","PLA shell conduction only; no resolved airflow or component temperatures.":"仅计算 PLA 外壳导热，未求解气流或部件温度。","Earlier · ventilation sensitivity":"早期研究 · 通风敏感性","Shell conduction plus a well-mixed air balance; algebraic what-ifs, not CFD.":"外壳导热加上充分混合的空气平衡，属于代数情景推算，并非 CFD。","Earlier · transient shell study":"早期研究 · 外壳瞬态分析","A shell-storage model, whose time axis is not the robot’s warm-up time.":"外壳蓄热模型，其时间轴不代表机器人的升温时间。","What this study can support":"这项研究可支持什么","Qualitative design review and a measurement plan. The airflow residual target was not met; use is under a documented analyst waiver, with no mesh-independence study.":"定性设计评审与测量计划。气流求解未达到残差目标；分析人员已记录豁免后使用，且尚未开展网格无关性研究。","Archived geometry: the 36GY motor envelope, generic boards and simplified cameras differ from the installed hardware. The lower shell extension is missing.":"使用存档几何模型：36GY 电机外形包络、通用板卡和简化相机均与实际安装的硬件不同。模型缺少下方外壳延伸段。","No conduction through the PLA or radiation; housing results are adiabatic wall-face temperatures. No filament qualification or robot warm-up prediction is established.":"未计入 PLA 内部导热或辐射；外壳结果为绝热壁面温度。尚未建立打印线材适用性结论，也不能据此预测机器人的升温过程。","Next measurements: actual fan flow and component heat at the real duty cycle, especially camera power. The CFD results stay separate from live controller and sensor tests.":"下一步测量：真实工作循环下的实际风扇流量与部件发热，尤其是相机功率。CFD 结果与实时控制程序及传感器测试保持独立。","Reports and figures are in English. This website includes the compact evidence records; the large CAD, mesh and solver working archives remain local.":"报告和图表为英文。本网站收录了精简的证据记录；大型 CAD、网格与求解器工作存档仍保留在本地。","Casing cooling study: air enters the fitted shell and exits through the top fan. Native Fluent pathlines at an assumed 1 CFM; playback time is illustrative.":"外壳冷却研究：空气进入装好侧壳的外壳，再经顶部风扇排出。Fluent 原生迹线基于假设的 1 CFM 流量；播放时间仅作示意。","Side-shell-fitted case. Native Fluent pathlines show the route toward the top exhaust fan, coloured by speed. The assumed flow is 1 CFM; tracer playback time is not physical time.":"装有侧壳的算例。Fluent 原生迹线显示空气流向顶部排风扇的路径，并按速度着色。假设流量为 1 CFM；示踪播放时间并非真实物理时间。","ANSYS airflow and heat simulation":"ANSYS 气流与热仿真","Vent placement changes the flow":"通风口位置会改变气流","Intake opening":"进气开口","Side-shell fitted":"装有侧壳","Modelled casing resistance at 1 CFM:":"1 CFM 下的模型外壳阻力：","Solved intake map for the fitted shell. The horizontal side vents carry about 24% of intake on each wall.":"装有侧壳时求解得到的进气分布图。每侧的水平通风口各承担约 24% 的进气。","Cooling results use assumed airflow and heat loads; fan RPM and component temperatures still need physical checks.":"冷却结果采用假设气流与热负荷；风扇转速与部件温度仍需实物检查。","CFD with assumed inputs":"输入值基于假设的 CFD","Qualitative intake paths and thermal design priorities for the stated model":"指定模型的定性进气路径与热设计优先事项","Installed fan RPM, measured temperatures, material qualification and an optimised vent layout":"安装后的风扇转速、实测温度、材料适用性及优化后的通风口布局","The software results sit at the first two levels; the casing pilot adds numerical evidence with assumed inputs. The last three levels require physical measurements.":"软件结果属于前两个等级；外壳初步研究补充了基于假设输入的数值证据。最后三个等级需要实物测量。","How should fan speed and vent layout be chosen?":"应如何选择风扇转速与通风口布局？","Choose RPM without installed-flow data":"缺少安装后流量数据就选择转速","Study the flow path, then match fan and casing measurements":"先研究气流路径，再结合风扇与外壳测量","Vents must guide air past the heat sources. A controlled-flow CFD case identifies the routes to inspect; fan curves at known RPM and measured heat loads are needed to turn that into a speed and vent-design decision.":"通风口必须引导空气经过热源。受控流量 CFD 算例用于找出需要检查的路径；还需已知转速下的风扇曲线与实测热负荷，才能据此决定转速与通风口设计。","The present 1 CFM pilot gives design priorities, not a validated RPM setting or a final vent geometry.":"目前的 1 CFM 初步研究用于确定设计优先事项，并不代表已验证的转速设置或最终通风口几何结构。","A validated cooling fan RPM, an optimised vent layout, PLA qualification or real robot warm-up time":"经验证的冷却风扇转速、优化后的通风口布局、PLA 适用性或真实机器人的升温时间","Motor · 36GY model":"电机 · 36GY 模型","I used ANSYS Fluent to study how air passes through the casing and carries heat away from the controller, cameras and drive electronics.":"我使用 ANSYS Fluent 研究空气如何流经外壳，并带走控制器、摄像头和驱动电子设备的热量。","of simulated intake enters through the horizontal side vents with the shell fitted. The casing changes how air reaches the internal components.":"的模拟进气量通过装上侧壳后的水平侧通风口进入。外壳会改变空气到达内部元件的路径。","Heat concentrates around the cameras":"热量集中在摄像头周围","simulated mean camera surface temperature at an assumed combined heat load of 1 W. The camera mounts form the hottest region in this model. Treat it as an upper bound: the model leaves out conduction through the PLA casing and radiation, and has not been checked against measurements.":"是两颗摄像头在假设总热负载为 1 W 时的模拟平均表面温度。摄像头支架是此模型中温度最高的区域。这应视为上限估计：模型没有计入 PLA 外壳的导热和辐射散热，也尚未与实测数据核对。","Simulation conditions: assumed airflow of 1 CFM, 6.75 W total heat and a 25 °C room. Temperatures are model estimates rather than measurements from the robot.":"模拟条件：假设风量为 1 CFM，总热负载为 6.75 W，室温为 25 °C。温度为模型估算值，并非机器人实测值。","The casing study examines intake paths and heat distribution around the Pi, cameras and drive electronics. I compared open and fitted-shell geometry in ANSYS Fluent, then added component heat loads to the fitted-shell model.":"外壳研究分析树莓派、摄像头及驱动电子设备周围的进气路径与热量分布。我在 ANSYS Fluent 中比较了开放式与装上侧壳的几何模型，再为装上侧壳的模型加入元件热负载。","Airflow through the casing":"流经外壳的气流","A uniform body-force actuator represents the top exhaust fan at an assumed flow of 1 CFM. Holding flow constant makes the intake paths comparable across the two casing configurations. Fan rotation and RPM-dependent performance are outside the model’s scope.":"模型使用均匀体积力执行器表示顶部排风扇，假设风量为 1 CFM。固定风量让两种外壳配置的进气路径可以直接比较。风扇旋转及随转速变化的性能不在模型范围内。","Open assembly":"开放式装配","Intake shares at the assumed 1 CFM; minor openings are omitted. The thermal simulation uses the fitted-shell configuration.":"假设风量为 1 CFM 时各开口的进气占比；省略了较小的开口。热模拟使用装上侧壳的配置。","In the open assembly, about 66% of intake enters through the fan-side arch. Fitting the side-shell redirects air toward the side vents. About 37% enters from below in the fitted model; this share may be overstated because the lower 90 mm shell extension is omitted.":"在开放式装配中，约 66% 的进气量经风扇侧拱形开口进入。装上侧壳后，空气转向侧通风口。在装上侧壳的模型中，约 37% 的空气从下方进入；由于省略了下部 90 mm 的外壳延伸段，此占比可能偏高。","Simulated pressure rise across the casing at the assumed flow; this is not a measured fan operating point.":"这是在假设风量下模拟得到的外壳压升，并非风扇实际工作点的测量值。","Component temperatures":"元件温度","The thermal simulation applies an assumed 6.75 W across the motor, three boards and two cameras in a 25 °C room. Including buoyancy lowers the modelled motor temperature by about 3.6 °C compared with frozen airflow. The cameras remain near 70 °C at their assumed combined 1 W heat load.":"热模拟在 25 °C 室温下，为电机、三块电路板及两颗摄像头施加假设总热负载 6.75 W。与固定气流相比，加入浮力后电机的模拟温度降低约 3.6 °C。两颗摄像头在假设总热负载为 1 W 时，温度仍接近 70 °C。","Mean component-surface temperatures for the fitted shell, corrected to the assumed heat loads. Board assignments and power distribution are model assumptions. These values do not represent chip-junction, motor-winding or sensor temperatures.":"装上侧壳后、按假设热负载修正的元件平均表面温度。电路板配置及功率分配为模型假设。这些数值并不代表芯片结温、电机绕组温度或传感器温度。","Intake and casing temperature maps":"进气与外壳温度分布图","Casing temperature with and without buoyancy. The buoyancy-on peak is 66.4 °C, or 67.2 °C after correction to the full assumed camera load, with heat concentrated near the camera mounts. White areas mark vents or excluded surfaces; the fan-side arch is closed.":"包含与不包含浮力时的外壳温度。包含浮力时，最高温度为 66.4 °C；按摄像头完整假设热负载修正后为 67.2 °C，热量集中在摄像头支架附近。白色区域表示通风口或未纳入计算的表面；风扇侧拱形开口处于封闭状态。","Model scope: exploratory steady laminar CFD with simplified geometry and assumed heat loads. The solver used relaxed residual criteria, and mesh independence was not assessed. PLA conduction and radiation were excluded; per-watt temperature estimates carry about ±25% numerical sensitivity.":"模型范围：采用简化几何和假设热负载的探索性稳态层流 CFD。求解器使用放宽的残差标准，未评估网格独立性。模型未计入 PLA 导热和辐射；单位功率温度估算的数值敏感度约为 ±25%。","Casing cooling":"外壳散热","Airflow and surface-temperature estimates for simplified casing geometry at assumed flow and heat loads":"在假设风量与热负载下，对简化外壳几何进行气流与表面温度估算","Stair Mapper simulation: staircase modelling and camera-coverage analysis.":"Stair Mapper 仿真：楼梯建模与相机覆盖分析。","Stair Mapper":"Stair Mapper","Simulated front camera view with an open fire door boxed at 4.2 m and stair treads coloured from green to red":"仿真前置相机画面：4.2 米外一扇打开的防火门被框出，楼梯踏步由绿渐变到红","Stair Mapper detection simulation: coverage colours show which hazard sizes the camera can resolve, with an open fire door detected at 4.2 m.":"Stair Mapper 检测仿真：覆盖颜色表示相机可分辨的隐患尺寸，画面中的敞开防火门在 4.2 m 处被检出。","Before a robot can be tested on a stairwell, the stairwell has to be measured. Stair Mapper is my concept for a handrail-mounted measuring device and the desktop app that goes with it. As the device rolls along the rail, a 600 P/R rotary encoder gives the distance axis, an active linear scale measures rail spacing and clamp spring travel, and a 9-axis IMU measures the stair slope and detects turns. The app rebuilds the inner handrail, flights, landings, rail layers and vertical members in 3D as the samples arrive.":"要在一个楼梯间里测试机器人，先得把这个楼梯间测量出来。Stair Mapper 是我构思的一款挂在扶手上的测量设备，以及配套的桌面应用。设备沿扶手滚动时，600 P/R 旋转编码器提供距离轴，主动式光栅尺测量扶手间距和夹紧弹簧的行程，9 轴 IMU 测量楼梯坡度并识别转弯。随着数据不断传入，应用会在 3D 中重建内侧扶手、梯段、平台、多层扶手和竖杆。","Stair Mapper app showing capture controls, a 3D model of a Hong Kong protected fire-exit stair, two camera views and robot telemetry":"Stair Mapper 应用画面：采集控制、香港防烟走火楼梯的 3D 模型、两路相机画面和机器人遥测数据","Stair Mapper simulation of a Hong Kong protected fire-exit stair: capture controls, 3D reconstruction, both camera views and synthetic telemetry indexed by encoder distance.":"Stair Mapper 中的香港受保护逃生楼梯仿真：采集控制、3D 重建、双相机画面，以及按编码器距离索引的模拟遥测数据。",Part:"部分","Distance axis":"距离轴","A 600 P/R encoder at 0.333 mm per tick; every sample is indexed by distance along the rail":"600 P/R 编码器，每格 0.333 mm；每个采样都按沿扶手的距离索引","Stair profiles":"楼梯参数","Parameterised stairwells: Hong Kong protected fire exits, rounded or sharp 90° turns, floor count, rail height and incline, fire-door positions and finishes":"参数化的楼梯间：香港防烟走火楼梯、圆角或直角 90° 转弯、楼层数、扶手高度与倾角、防火门位置和表面材质","Clamp study":"夹紧机构研究","A top-down wheel view comparing the spring-linked two-wheel clamp at a square 90° joint and at a rounded elbow, with the spring-load curve":"俯视轮组视图，对比弹簧联动的双轮夹紧机构在直角 90° 接头和圆角弯头处的表现，并附弹簧载荷曲线","Camera planning":"相机规划",Exports:"导出","Capture JSON for a USD and Isaac Sim asset pipeline, and STEP geometry through CadQuery":"导出采集 JSON，供 USD 和 Isaac Sim 资源管线使用；并通过 CadQuery 导出 STEP 几何",Delivery:"交付","A Windows desktop installer, so it runs without a development setup":"Windows 桌面安装包，无需配置开发环境即可运行","The design study uses synthetic readings and forces to explore stair geometry, clamp motion and camera placement.":"设计研究使用模拟读数与作用力，分析楼梯几何、夹紧机构运动及相机布置。","Hazard size":"隐患尺寸","Needs on the surface":"表面上所需的分辨率","Coverage colour":"覆盖颜色","Small, such as a cigarette butt or litter":"小型，例如烟头或垃圾","At least 400 pixels per metre":"每米至少 400 像素",Green:"绿色",Medium:"中型","At least 200 pixels per metre":"每米至少 200 像素",Yellow:"黄色","Large, such as a box or an open fire door":"大型，例如纸箱或打开的防火门","At least 80 pixels per metre":"每米至少 80 像素",Red:"红色","Computed for every stair and landing surface in a GPU shader from the camera’s field of view, angle and resolution (1080p or 4K), with walls and landings blocking the view. Below 80 pixels per metre a surface is blind.":"在 GPU shader 中为每个楼梯和平台表面计算，依据是相机的视场角、角度和分辨率（1080p 或 4K），墙体和平台会遮挡视线。低于每米 80 像素的表面属于盲区。","An open fire door is a large object, so it is detected at 4.2 m even where coverage has turned red.":"打开的防火门属于大型物体，所以即使在覆盖已转为红色的位置，4.2 米外也能识别出来。","Simulated front camera view with a cigarette butt boxed at 1.5 m on a green landing":"仿真前置相机画面：绿色平台上 1.5 米处的一个烟头被框出","A cigarette butt is small, so it is detected only at 1.5 m, inside the green zone.":"烟头属于小型物体，只有在 1.5 米、位于绿色区域内时才能识别。","Stair Mapper generates simulated detections and confidence values from the coverage model. A detection appears when the hazard is within 6.5 m, in front of the camera, visible in two consecutive frames and clear of walls, with enough pixels for its size class.":"Stair Mapper 根据覆盖模型生成模拟检测及置信度。隐患需位于相机前方 6.5 m 内，连续两帧可见、无遮挡，且像素密度达到对应尺寸类别的要求，才会出现检测框。","Stair Mapper connects stairwell geometry with camera planning. The measuring-device concept and desktop app explore rail reconstruction, clamp motion and which hazard sizes the cameras can resolve.":"Stair Mapper 将楼梯间几何与相机规划联系起来。测量设备概念及桌面应用探索轨道重建、夹紧机构运动，以及相机能分辨的隐患尺寸。","The mapper explores a path from measured rail geometry to prepared simulation scenes. Its export design targets USD and Isaac Sim assets, plus STEP geometry through CadQuery. The current robot simulator runs in Unreal Engine with a catalogue of checked stairwells.":"测绘工具探索从测量轨道几何到预置仿真场景的路径。其导出设计面向 USD 与 Isaac Sim 资产，并通过 CadQuery 生成 STEP 几何。当前机器人模拟器运行于 Unreal Engine，使用经过检查的楼梯间目录。","The coverage overlay and simulated detections, for any camera angle, field of view and resolution":"适用于不同相机角度、视场和分辨率的覆盖叠加图及模拟检测","Camera coverage and simulated detections":"相机覆盖与模拟检测","The coverage model estimates which surfaces a camera can resolve for each hazard size before the robot is installed. It uses camera angle, field of view, resolution and occlusion to colour the stair and landing surfaces.":"覆盖模型在机器人安装前，估算相机针对不同隐患尺寸能分辨的表面。模型根据相机角度、视场、分辨率与遮挡，对楼梯和平台表面着色。","Stair Mapper workflow video":"Stair Mapper 工作流程视频","GLSL coverage shaders":"GLSL 覆盖着色器","USD / STEP export design":"USD / STEP 导出设计","Three parts":"三个部分","The Stairio Simulator has three parts: the Unreal simulator, Stair Mapper, and ANSYS simulation.":"Stairio Simulator 由三个部分组成：Unreal 模拟器、Stair Mapper，以及 ANSYS 仿真。","1. Unreal simulator":"1. Unreal 模拟器","2. Stair Mapper":"2. Stair Mapper","3. ANSYS simulation":"3. ANSYS 仿真","Runs the robot’s own controller against virtual motor, IMU and cameras in Unreal Engine stairwells. It tests navigation, image capture and the operator workflow.":"在 Unreal Engine 楼梯间中运行机器人的原始控制器，并连接虚拟电机、IMU 与相机，用来测试导航、图像拍摄及操作流程。","A measuring-device concept and desktop study of stairwell and rail reconstruction, clamp motion and camera coverage, using synthetic readings.":"通过合成读数探索测量设备概念，以及楼梯间和轨道重建、夹紧机构运动与相机覆盖的桌面研究。","ANSYS Fluent studies airflow through the casing and heat around its components, using an assumed fan flow and component heat loads.":"ANSYS Fluent 使用假设风扇风量与元件热负载，研究流经外壳的气流及元件周围的热量。","Unreal simulator":"Unreal 模拟器","Unreal simulator images":"Unreal 模拟器图像","From concept to a working robot":"从概念到完整运行的机器人","The product comes to life through six connected stages. Bench tests, simulation and assembled-unit testing feed changes back into earlier decisions as the mechanics, electronics and software come together.":"产品开发分为六个相互衔接的阶段。随着机械、电子和软件逐步整合，台架测试、仿真和整机测试的结果会反馈到前面的设计，推动下一轮修改。","Concept, mechanical simulation and iteration":"概念、机械结构仿真与迭代","Start with the inspection task, rail grip, camera coverage and balance. Model the mechanism, simulate motion and clearances, then revise the structure against test findings.":"从巡检任务、扶手夹持、相机覆盖和平衡出发，建立机构模型，仿真运动与间隙，再根据测试结果修改结构。","A mechanical concept ready for prototyping":"可进入原型制作的机械方案","Electronic design and breadboard testing":"电子设计与面包板测试","Connect the controller, motor drive, sensors and cameras on the bench. Check power, signals and component behaviour before committing the connections to a board.":"在台架上连接控制器、电机驱动、传感器和相机，先检查供电、信号和元件响应，再将连接整合到电路板。","A tested electrical prototype":"经过测试的电气原型","Compact PCB and BMS":"紧凑 PCB 与 BMS","Consolidate the electronics into a compact PCB and integrate battery management (BMS). Revisit board placement, connectors, wiring and service access as the package takes shape.":"将电子元件整合到紧凑 PCB，并集成电池管理系统（BMS）。随着内部布局成形，反复检查板卡位置、连接器、线束和维修空间。","Integrated electronics and battery management":"整合电子系统与电池管理","Heat study and enclosure design":"热分析与外壳设计","Study component heat and casing airflow, then refine the enclosure around cooling, camera visibility, rail clearance and assembly access. Feed packaging changes back into the mechanical layout.":"研究元件发热和外壳内的气流，结合散热、相机视野、扶手间隙及装配空间改进外壳，并将封装变化反馈到机械布局。","An enclosure shaped by thermal and mechanical checks":"结合热分析与机械检查确定的外壳","Firmware and software handshake":"固件与软件握手联调","Bring motor control, sensing and image capture together with the operator software. Check that commands, acknowledgements, telemetry and stop behaviour agree across the hardware and software interfaces.":"将电机控制、传感器和图像采集接入操作软件，检查硬件与软件接口之间的指令、确认、遥测和停止行为是否一致。","One connected robot and operator workflow":"贯通机器人与操作端的工作流程","Fully functional unit":"完整运行的整机","Assemble the robot and run it on the test rail and in a stairwell. Demonstrate movement, camera capture and the laptop dashboard together, then use the observed problems to start the next iteration.":"完成整机装配，在测试扶手和楼梯间运行，联动演示运动、相机采集和笔记本控制台，再根据实际问题启动下一轮迭代。","An end-to-end working demonstration":"端到端运行演示","The Stairio 360 demonstration shows the existing hardware and operator software working together. The compact remaster is a further design iteration; its PCB/BMS integration, thermal qualification and physical validation remain work to complete.":"Stairio 360 演示展示了现有硬件与操作软件的联动。紧凑重设计方案是后续迭代，其 PCB/BMS 集成、热性能确认和实物验证仍待完成。","Explore the simulation behind the next iteration":"查看支撑下一轮迭代的仿真工作","See how the physical Stairio product comes together":"查看 Stairio 实物产品的完整开发过程","Four parts":"四个部分","The Stairio Simulator has four parts: Unreal for controller and camera testing, Isaac Sim for remaster mechanical design, Stair Mapper for geometry and coverage planning, and ANSYS for enclosure airflow and heat studies.":"Stairio Simulator 包含四个部分：Unreal 用于控制器和相机测试，Isaac Sim 用于重设计方案的机械验证，Stair Mapper 用于几何重建与覆盖规划，ANSYS 用于外壳气流和热分析。","2. Isaac Sim mechanical design":"2. Isaac Sim 机械设计","Designs and tests the compact remaster’s mechanism in native physics, including wheel contact, passive springs, balance and full-assembly clearance on repeatable rail courses.":"在原生物理环境中设计并测试紧凑重设计机构，利用可重复的扶手路线检查轮轨接触、被动弹簧、平衡和整机间隙。","3. Stair Mapper":"3. Stair Mapper","4. ANSYS simulation":"4. ANSYS 仿真","Isaac Sim mechanical design":"Isaac Sim 机械设计","The compact remaster adds a second simulation path: native NVIDIA Isaac Sim trials for mechanical design. The full model is driven by two wheel motors, with gravity, spring forces and rail contact determining its motion. This makes grip, balance and packaging part of the experiment.":"紧凑重设计增加了一条仿真路径：在 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 中开展原生机械试验。整机模型由两台轮电机驱动，其运动由重力、弹簧力和扶手接触共同决定，夹持、平衡和内部布局因此成为试验的一部分。","Design the test environment":"设计测试环境","Reusable USD rail courses cover inclines, bends, vertical links, landings, brackets and nearby walls. The rail, supports and surrounding structure all participate in collisions.":"可复用的 USD 扶手路线覆盖斜坡、弯道、竖直连接段、平台、支架和邻近墙面。扶手、支撑和周边结构均参与碰撞计算。","Test the whole assembly":"测试完整装配","Include the frame, battery case, guides, springs and passive carriers so a wheel-level success cannot hide a packaging collision.":"将框架、电池壳、导向件、弹簧和被动轮支架纳入模型，避免只测试轮组而遗漏整机干涉。","Turn failures into revisions":"根据失败结果修改设计","Recorded contacts and body poses guide changes to the frame opening, follower spacing, guide length and electronics placement. Repeat the same courses after each change.":"根据记录的接触和机身姿态，修改框架开口、随动轮间距、导向长度和电子元件位置；每次修改后重跑相同路线。","Isaac Sim study comparing a completed rounded vertical link with a stalled sharp corner and the remaster assembly envelope":"Isaac Sim 研究图：圆弧竖直连接段通过情况、直角转弯卡滞情况及重设计整机包络","Historical full-assembly sweep: a rounded vertical link completes, while the exact sharp corner stalls. Later corrected-mesh reruns confirm that sharp-corner traversal remains unresolved.":"早期整机批量试验：圆弧竖直连接段完成通行，精确直角处仍卡滞。后续修正网格后的复测确认，直角通行问题尚未解决。","The remaster remains an engineering study. Rounded transitions have passing cases under stated assumptions; exact sharp corners, reduced-grip balance and tight wall clearances still drive the next design iteration. These results do not establish a completed remaster or building-scale endurance.":"重设计方案仍处于工程研究阶段。圆弧过渡在指定假设下有通过案例；精确直角、低附着下的平衡和狭窄墙面间隙仍是下一轮设计的重点。这些结果尚不能证明重设计整机已完成或具备整栋建筑巡检的续航能力。","Designing the Isaac Sim workbench":"Isaac Sim 仿真平台设计","Unreal exercises the existing V7 controller, camera views and operator workflow. Isaac Sim addresses a different question for the compact remaster: can the proposed mechanism move through the real clearance constraints? The remaster has its own model and trial controller; it is separate from the pinned V7 software-compatibility baseline.":"Unreal 测试现有 V7 控制器、相机视角和操作流程。Isaac Sim 研究紧凑重设计中的另一项问题：机构能否在实际空间约束下通行？重设计方案使用独立模型和试验控制器，与固定版本的 V7 软件兼容性基线分开。","Design layer":"设计层","Implementation and purpose":"实现与用途","Robot model":"机器人模型","A full assembly with dynamic bodies, wheel joints, a passive spring-centred carrier, a spring-loaded jaw and external hardware collision geometry. Internal mating-part collisions are excluded.":"整机包括动态刚体、轮关节、被动弹簧回中支架、弹簧夹爪及外部硬件碰撞几何；内部配合零件之间的碰撞不在本次模型范围内。","World design":"环境设计","USD courses with rail meshes, underside fixtures, walls, stairs and floors; route metadata records stations and frames for measurement.":"USD 路线包含扶手网格、底部固定件、墙、楼梯和地面；路线元数据记录测量所需的里程与坐标系。","Physics and actuation":"物理与驱动","Native Isaac Sim 6.1, CPU TGS at 240 Hz, gravity and two torque-limited wheel motors. Passive springs apply equal and opposite forces; body motion is not prescribed after spawn.":"使用原生 Isaac Sim 6.1、240 Hz CPU TGS、重力和两台限扭轮电机。被动弹簧施加大小相等、方向相反的力；初始放置后不再指定机身运动。","Trial controller":"试验控制器","Commands the two wheel speeds. Clearance experiments use simulated body, route and support state; equivalent real-world sensing and localisation remain to implement.":"控制两轮转速。间隙试验使用仿真中的机身、路线和支撑状态；对应的实物感知与定位仍待实现。",Evidence:r,"Record body poses, wheel speeds, jaw motion, native contacts and input hashes. Replay stages reproduce the recorded poses for inspection.":"记录机身姿态、轮速、夹爪运动、原生接触信息和输入哈希。回放场景重现记录的姿态，供检查分析。",Acceptance:o,"Reach the goal without forbidden contact above the study’s 2 N threshold. An exit reached after a bracket collision is still a failed run.":"到达目标且没有超过研究所设 2 N 阈值的禁止接触。即使最终到达出口，途中撞击支架仍计为失败。","Iterate the model, the mechanism and the test":"同步迭代模型、机构与测试",Finding:"发现","Revision or next experiment":"修改或下一项试验","Frame and guide interference":"框架与导向件干涉","Open the rail-crossing window, shorten the follower footprint and replace long guides; rerun the full external geometry.":"扩大扶手通行开口、缩短随动轮接触跨度并替换长导向件，再使用完整外部几何重跑测试。","Sharp-corner contact jam":"直角处接触卡滞","Correct folded faces in the test-rail mesh and rerun all five affected courses. The robot still jams or collides; lower preload and slower drive do not establish a crossing.":"修正测试扶手网格的折叠面，并复测全部五条受影响路线。机器人仍有卡滞或碰撞；降低预紧力和速度尚未实现通过。","Battery placement and balance":"电池布局与平衡","Replace the earlier imposed mass/CG with a provisional component ledger. The upper battery is not self-righting; study roll, wall clearance and reduced grip together.":"用暂定的元件质量清单替代早期指定的质量和重心。上置电池布局不能自行回正，需要联合研究侧倾、墙面间隙和低附着工况。","Compact electronics packaging":"紧凑电子封装","Reserve space for the Pi, custom control PCB and BMS; test placement against rail transitions. Package reservations are not a finished circuit or qualified board.":"为 Pi、定制控制 PCB 和 BMS 预留空间，检查其在扶手过渡段的布局。空间预留不代表电路或板卡已完成验证。","Local remaster evidence checkpoint, 26 October 2026. Each study has its own assumptions; the later mass model does not requalify the earlier sweep.":"本地重设计验证记录截至 2026 年 10 月 26 日。各项研究采用各自的假设；后续质量模型不代表早期批量试验已重新验证。","Earlier full-assembly sweep":"早期整机批量试验","138 trials":"138 次试验","Archived native mechanical trials across design variants":"归档的多种设计版本原生机械试验","The retained candidate has 68 runs across 51 courses, with 42 clean runs; this is not 42 qualified courses.":"保留方案在 51 条路线上运行 68 次，其中 42 次无禁止接触通过；不能将其视为 42 条路线已通过验证。","Sharp-corner follow-up":"直角专项复测","29 trials":"29 次试验","Corrected meshes, contact isolation, packaging variants and timestep checks":"修正网格、接触隔离、封装变体和时间步长检查","All five affected corner courses rerun; no sharp-corner capability established.":"全部五条受影响转角路线均已复测，尚未确认直角通行能力。","Balance and wall study":"平衡与墙面间隙研究","26 trials":"26 次试验","Provisional component masses, stationary holds, disturbances and nearby-wall travel":"暂定元件质量、静止保持、扰动和邻墙行驶试验","Nominal straight-wall cases pass; reduced grip and constrained tilt still expose failures.":"标称条件下有直墙路线通过案例；低附着和受限侧倾仍会导致失败。","Tyre friction and compliance, printed-part strength, internal joints, camera mounting and wiring still need physical checks. These short mechanical trials do not simulate the battery, regeneration, electronics heating or mission endurance. Those checks belong to the later electrical, thermal and assembled-unit stages of development.":"轮胎摩擦与弹性、打印件强度、内部连接、相机安装和线束仍需实物检查。这些短程机械试验不模拟电池、能量回收、电子元件发热或任务续航；相关验证属于后续电气、热设计和整机开发阶段。","How should the simulation engines divide the work?":"仿真引擎如何分工？","One engine for every study":"全部研究使用同一引擎","Unreal for software and vision; Isaac Sim for mechanics":"Unreal 用于软件与视觉；Isaac Sim 用于机械","Unreal retains the existing controller, lens-position rendering and operator workflow. Isaac Sim tests the remaster’s contact mechanics, springs and full-assembly clearances with native physics.":"Unreal 保留现有控制器、镜头位置渲染和操作流程。Isaac Sim 使用原生物理测试重设计方案的接触力学、弹簧和整机间隙。","The two paths use separate models and validation records. Native physics still needs measured friction, mass and component behaviour before it predicts the built robot.":"两条路径使用独立模型与验证记录。原生物理模型仍需实测摩擦、质量和元件响应，才能预测实物表现。","Unreal motion and sensing":"Unreal 运动与感知","Rail-following motion and synthetic sensor feedback for V7 software tests; real sensor noise and physical response require hardware checks":"沿扶手运动与合成传感器反馈用于 V7 软件测试；真实传感器噪声和物理响应需通过硬件检查","Isaac Sim mechanics":"Isaac Sim 机械仿真","Native wheel contact, passive springs and full external assembly collisions for the remaster; mass/friction remain provisional and sharp corners remain unresolved":"重设计方案的原生轮轨接触、被动弹簧和完整外部装配碰撞；质量与摩擦仍为暂定值，直角通行尚未解决","Mechanical simulation":"机械仿真","Python trial runners":"Python 试验运行工具","Contact and clearance analysis":"接触与间隙分析","Open full-size diagram":"查看完整尺寸图解","Mechanical concept · compact remaster":"机械概念 · 紧凑重设计","An earlier shared-axle prototype study: the assembly layout on the left and passive carrier tilt on the right. Later full-assembly revisions change the packaging and joint limits.":"早期共轴原型研究：左侧为装配布局，右侧为被动支架的倾转示意。后续整机迭代修改了内部布局和关节限位。","Early remaster assembly with an upper battery, two springs and a shared tilting motor carrier, beside a diagram of its pivot motion":"早期重设计装配：上置电池、两根弹簧及共用倾转电机支架，旁边为支点运动示意图","Why balance and wall clearance must be tested together":"为什么要同时检查平衡与墙面间隙","Three recorded poses beside the same wall: the baseline has very little margin, reduced grip leads to contact, and an away-tilted wall mode improves clearance in this straight-section test. Body width alone does not describe the space the robot needs.":"同一墙面旁的三组记录姿态：基线的间隙很小，附着降低后发生碰撞，向远离墙面方向倾斜的模式则在这段直线测试中改善了间隙。仅看机身宽度，无法判断机器人实际需要的空间。","Three simulated robot cross-sections comparing a near-wall baseline, a low-friction wall collision and an improved away-tilted pose; red crosses mark the estimated centre of gravity":"三组机器人仿真横截面，对比邻墙基线、低摩擦下的墙面碰撞和改善后的远墙倾斜姿态；红色十字标记估算重心","Build the obstacles into the simulation":"将障碍物纳入仿真","Environment-construction previews show sharp turns, unsupported vertical links, landings, wall brackets and a three-storey route. The note inside this earlier figure refers to the environment-only phase; subsequent full-robot trials are reported below.":"环境构建预览展示直角、无支撑竖直连接段、平台、墙面支架和三层路线。这张早期图中的说明对应仅构建环境的阶段；后续整机试验见下文。","Six rail test environments showing underside supports, a sharp corner, vertical links, a switchback landing, a wall corner and a three-storey staircase":"六个扶手测试环境，展示底部支撑、直角、竖直连接段、折返平台、墙角和三层楼梯","Fix the test mesh, then test the mechanism again":"修正测试网格后，重新验证机构","Repairing the folded corner mesh removes an environment error, but the progress curves still stop before the corner. Contact-force and roll traces help separate the follower jam from a simulation-mesh problem.":"修复转角网格的折叠面消除了环境错误，但进度曲线仍停在转角前。接触力和侧倾记录有助于区分随动轮卡滞与仿真网格问题。","Four diagnostic plots comparing original and corrected corner meshes, stalled route progress, backward follower forces and unsuccessful roll-control experiments":"四幅诊断图，对比原始与修正转角网格、卡滞的路线进度、随动轮反向作用力和未成功的侧倾控制试验"};export{o as Acceptance,k as Area,u as Cameras,v as Cloud,C as Controller,a as Decisions,T as Delivery,h as Device,r as Evidence,M as Exports,F as Finding,x as Green,p as Image,e as Media,U as Medium,c as Modules,b as Operator,s as Overview,d as Package,P as Part,f as Passed,R as Red,n as Result,S as Robotics,g as Rule,t as Runtime,w as Simulation,A as Source,m as Speaker,i as Stack,l as Testing,y as Tooling,I as Yellow,N as default};
